162
00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:20.960
One involves begging. The other involves getting paid. On Wishonia, this would not require a chapter to explain.

163
00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:25.180
But your species is very attached to its suffering, so here we are.

164
00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:32.830
The dogs need to turn around and notice the banquet. I've been watching them fight over the bowl for eighty years.

165
00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:36.380
The banquet is right there. It has always been right there.

166
00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.260
The dogs are very focused. They have written reports about the bowl.

167
00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:46.650
They have held conferences about bowl strategy. They have hired consultants to optimize bowl access.

168
00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:50.440
None of them have turned around. Turn around.
